  "releaseNotes": "v5.4.15 (forks 2.4.13, unchanged) - FIXED (WebGL): a buffer first written by a device copy kept a float texture and an int kernel read it as nothing; GL errors throw instead of zeros. FIXED (WebGPU): plain loads/stores of an atomic view field (ArrayView1D) compile; an invalid shader fails the readback instead of returning the old buffer. FIXED (WebGL): Atomic.Add the emulation cannot do throws UnsupportedKernelFeatureException instead of a wrong answer. Full history: CHANGELOG.md",
